{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-28454-r4517713","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Cola Cake","sourcePageId":28454,"sourceRevision":"4517713","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T03:01:30Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Cola%20Cake&oldid=4517713","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:38:21.252Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for cake","Category:Recipes for dessert","Category:Recipes for frosting and icing","Category:Recipes using baking soda","Category:Recipes using buttermilk","Category:Recipes using cocoa powder","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using margarine","Category:Recipes using marshmallow","Category:Recipes using powdered sugar","Category:Recipes using soda pop","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes using white sugar","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"7f8c014cd9f31c78005eae8c3a2a5013e7b00e235345ffebbe07c4f3f374347f","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Cake recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Dessert|Dessert]] | [[Cookbook:Cake|Cake]]\n__NOTOC__\n==Ingredients==\n===Cake===\n*2 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] (275 g / 9.7 oz) [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n*2 cups (450 g / 16 oz) white granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n*1 cup (250 ml / 8.5 oz) [[Cookbook:Cola|cola]]\n*2 sticks (250 g / 8.8 oz / 1 cup) [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]]\n*3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Cocoa|cocoa]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]]\n*½ cup (125 ml / 4.2 oz) [[Cookbook:Buttermilk|buttermilk]]\n*½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Baking Soda|baking soda]]\n*1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Vanilla|vanilla]] extract\n*1 ½ cup (125 g / 4.4 oz) miniature [[Cookbook:Marshmallow|marshmallows]]\n\n===Frosting===\n*6 tablespoons cola\n*2 tablespoons cocoa\n*1 stick (125 g / 4.4 oz) margarine\n*1 teaspoon vanilla\n*4 cups (500 g / 1.1 lb) [[Cookbook:Powdered Sugar|powdered sugar]]\n*1 cup (80 g / 2.8 oz) [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Nut|nuts]] (optional)\n\n==Procedure==\n===Cake===\n#Combine flour and sugar in a bowl.\n#Mix cola, margarine, and cocoa in a [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]], and bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]].\n#Pour over flour/sugar mixture and mix well.\n#Beat the eggs and mix them in. Add milk, soda, vanilla and marshmallows to make thin batter. Marshmallows will float to the surface.\n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] in a 9x13-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] (23x33 [[Cookbook:Centimetre (cm)|cm]]) pan at {{Convert|350|F|C}} for 35 minutes. Make frosting before it cools.\n\n===Frosting===\n#Mix cola, cocoa, and margarine in a pan and bring to a boil.\n#Add vanilla, sugar, and nuts. Mix until smooth.\n#Spread the warm frosting on the cake.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cake]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cocoa powder]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for frosting and icing]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking soda]]\n[[Category:Recipes using white sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using powdered sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using buttermilk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using soda pop]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]\n[[Category:Recipes using marshmallow]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Cola Cake","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 cups (275 g / 9.7 oz) flour","sourceText":"2 cups (275 g / 9.7 oz) flour","amountText":"2 cups (275 g / 9.7 oz) flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 cups (450 g / 16 oz) white granulated sugar","sourceText":"2 cups (450 g / 16 oz) white granulated sugar","amountText":"2 cups (450 g / 16 oz) white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 cup (250 ml / 8.5 oz) cola","sourceText":"1 cup (250 ml / 8.5 oz) cola","amountText":"1 cup (250 ml / 8.5 oz) cola","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 sticks (250 g / 8.8 oz / 1 cup) margarine","sourceText":"2 sticks (250 g / 8.8 oz / 1 cup) margarine","amountText":"2 sticks (250 g / 8.8 oz / 1 cup) margarine","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"3 tablespoons cocoa","sourceText":"3 tablespoons cocoa","amountText":"3 tablespoons cocoa","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 eggs","sourceText":"2 eggs","amountText":"2 eggs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"½ cup (125 ml / 4.2 oz) buttermilk","sourceText":"½ cup (125 ml / 4.2 oz) buttermilk","amountText":"½ cup (125 ml / 4.2 oz) buttermilk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"½ teaspoon baking soda","sourceText":"½ teaspoon baking soda","amountText":"½ teaspoon baking soda","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"1 teaspoon vanilla extract","sourceText":"1 teaspoon vanilla extract","amountText":"1 teaspoon vanilla extract","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding